            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.13.10

- Fixed a glitchy full-screen lyric transition where the lines appeared to converge and then split apart on each line change. Only the scroll slide is animated now; line brightness crossfades on its own without moving the layout.
- Made the current lyric line stand out more clearly again — full brightness against distinctly dimmer neighbors.
]]></description>
